{"v":3,"catch":"貓咪都武裝起來了。警告！","desc":"踏入一片混亂的戰場，生存至上──而最兇猛的敵人竟然是……武裝貓咪！在這款狂野的射擊遊戲中，你將在動態地圖上與狡猾的持械貓咪展開激戰。每一次遭遇都充滿變數，每個角落都可能隱藏著新的敵人，只有最精準的槍法和最快的反應才能讓你活下來。\n\n智取、火力壓制、堅持到最後，戰勝這些武裝貓咪，贏得勝利，成為競技場的終極冠軍。你準備好接受挑戰了嗎？","publisher":"CGI LAB GAMES","release":"2025-12-11","genres":["動作","射擊","策略","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0674eaac609f443e26e51a0c98ba9a42765256fdbb304786a84c3a849a76601b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cbc0af0b798c2644c52db21c1f9d9e95793dacefd65d750b1cb2678c719ab7c0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8d9d38954991182d1e394b359417b1bf0a6d5ec86b9ab955cfd5cd689931f991.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8685c05f4438355272dc68da4ac0c609f4e689e1643da87c6f48069666000af0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e88f3efaddeeba3b71b64f506c5baf64aa841c4bb61cfd3512d58328829ceb3d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/874639c1bac3f38db2e91b1ba10158e87229f2e9cc832499c3561765392edc49.jpg"],"titleId":"01002aa025b3a000","dlc":[]}